{"2026.5.8:P02-Q06":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>二氧化碳制乙醇的粒子计数</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题6 · P02-Q06</div><h1>二氧化碳制乙醇的粒子计数</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/物质的量/阿伏加德罗常数</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：检查体积条件、同位素中子数、可逆反应和溶液氧原子计量。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/原子的构成结构</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡状态</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/醇类</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>6. <img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:1;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">资源化是实现“双碳”目标的重要途径。如<img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:1;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">催化加氢可合成高附加值产品乙醇，反应原理为<img src=\"chem-asset:9d74d6505215b498168206b2a718bb7b5eb0930293ce7d211cf361c26f466781:2;\" style=\"width:200.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:06e32b993574296d77645e6cc962347ee480e9c5542449e7633b1d73aaaa4d0f:3;\" style=\"width:90.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。设<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:4;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阿伏加德罗常数的值，下列说法正确的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:8a59032cbbf346dcb8cc68359f0ef59a2851bc89828da1cd94567aa01fe0cf79:5;\" style=\"width:75.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">含有的分子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:4;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. <img src=\"chem-asset:1b6437bc5bb2c49c84353dcbcd01a80d52af84686e66dacdc8abb4b431a5555a:6;\" style=\"width:74.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">含有的中子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:4;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:696f323bca2f67504416e61890c7415729194639c9608d4b82c003f52478a1ac:7;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与足量<img src=\"chem-asset:066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec:8;\" style=\"width:22.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">充分反应，转移的电子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:b0bae629e2fc2cc68e247e1a16fff7115dffe3e60ea286fb40c81805f9db5c3d:9;\" style=\"width:38.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:64e5a96b1d9b07138a50186fc5c3b48ef8ff102bdb71f55d786525855c63d515:10;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">质量分数为<img src=\"chem-asset:c7d8e36960d44e8c47795dedbab8d3ab2af05372ee0310cc1b82df687db664f7:11;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的乙醇水溶液含有的氧原子数等于<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:4;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．没有注明标准状况这一条件，<img src=\"chem-asset:f302cbf35ad85bb9623281d8e9bbe8342f77d909ae65734645e7cd14d0416dc8:12;\" style=\"width:77.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">不一定是<img src=\"chem-asset:f3adcd8477552716c52c45acf23c30a5a5291451184e91a67c4abf6577810dcf:13;\" style=\"width:38.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，分子数不一定是<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:4;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A错误；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:1b6437bc5bb2c49c84353dcbcd01a80d52af84686e66dacdc8abb4b431a5555a:14;\" style=\"width:74.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的物质的量为<img src=\"chem-asset:2cf6e6598262acf628a18a1e944c381880bf02e962a4f7f077721f4519653be0:15;\" style=\"width:130.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，含有的中子的物质的量为<img src=\"chem-asset:8bd136e3c7df0d03cfb52cb3b37691c889b46e0969fa6ba3cfd911a256df454e:16;\" style=\"width:145.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，中子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:f14f8015ca23701713efc9325f347c6816c3ac98078cfd750012c6aeeaa9514f:17;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．反应可逆，<img src=\"chem-asset:018f4d621b2c7202d8944e1b29592cc3520a4ea565d0307aad988fd19078218b:18;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与足量<img src=\"chem-asset:02090ef2a616eb6443c91d37316f2f73bbd8a7ce907cb6fa59065aa00572f4df:19;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">充分反应生成的<img src=\"chem-asset:1c3d23c5a750990ff95609d2b897c54c1257303ddcf29b94abf7bcf4e814c902:20;\" style=\"width:61.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">小于<img src=\"chem-asset:f3adcd8477552716c52c45acf23c30a5a5291451184e91a67c4abf6577810dcf:13;\" style=\"width:38.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，转移电子数少于<img src=\"chem-asset:b0bae629e2fc2cc68e247e1a16fff7115dffe3e60ea286fb40c81805f9db5c3d:21;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:64e5a96b1d9b07138a50186fc5c3b48ef8ff102bdb71f55d786525855c63d515:22;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">质量分数为<img src=\"chem-asset:c7d8e36960d44e8c47795dedbab8d3ab2af05372ee0310cc1b82df687db664f7:23;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的乙醇水溶液中乙醇的物质的量为<img src=\"chem-asset:a23e860fbe85ebe7c9ff92ccfa2ffe7b4cfaa6aee416390961456fd794fd6f8d:24;\" style=\"width:144.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，水的物质的量为<img src=\"chem-asset:92f4487153d3b50030b95228bd9446a6b1d94f08a3bcae298f0ab153b08ea84a:25;\" style=\"width:144.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，氧原子的物质的量为<img src=\"chem-asset:2a0216bcf7d684ff00ff9c50e33f49d428c74ad748f773f20b90f56a1ead4073:26;\" style=\"width:169.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，含有的氧原子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:4;\" style=\"width:24.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D正确；</p><p>故答案为：D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["018f4d621b2c7202d8944e1b29592cc3520a4ea565d0307aad988fd19078218b","02090ef2a616eb6443c91d37316f2f73bbd8a7ce907cb6fa59065aa00572f4df","066ec03836e37939061574d886e795553111c52396a9c5ee587d85f5e267d1ec","06e32b993574296d77645e6cc962347ee480e9c5542449e7633b1d73aaaa4d0f","1b6437bc5bb2c49c84353dcbcd01a80d52af84686e66dacdc8abb4b431a5555a","1c3d23c5a750990ff95609d2b897c54c1257303ddcf29b94abf7bcf4e814c902","2a0216bcf7d684ff00ff9c50e33f49d428c74ad748f773f20b90f56a1ead4073","2cf6e6598262acf628a18a1e944c381880bf02e962a4f7f077721f4519653be0","64e5a96b1d9b07138a50186fc5c3b48ef8ff102bdb71f55d786525855c63d515","696f323bca2f67504416e61890c7415729194639c9608d4b82c003f52478a1ac","8a59032cbbf346dcb8cc68359f0ef59a2851bc89828da1cd94567aa01fe0cf79","8bd136e3c7df0d03cfb52cb3b37691c889b46e0969fa6ba3cfd911a256df454e","8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e","91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3","92f4487153d3b50030b95228bd9446a6b1d94f08a3bcae298f0ab153b08ea84a","9d74d6505215b498168206b2a718bb7b5eb0930293ce7d211cf361c26f466781","a23e860fbe85ebe7c9ff92ccfa2ffe7b4cfaa6aee416390961456fd794fd6f8d","b0bae629e2fc2cc68e247e1a16fff7115dffe3e60ea286fb40c81805f9db5c3d","bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742","c7d8e36960d44e8c47795dedbab8d3ab2af05372ee0310cc1b82df687db664f7","f14f8015ca23701713efc9325f347c6816c3ac98078cfd750012c6aeeaa9514f","f302cbf35ad85bb9623281d8e9bbe8342f77d909ae65734645e7cd14d0416dc8","f3adcd8477552716c52c45acf23c30a5a5291451184e91a67c4abf6577810dcf"],"sourceSha256":"580eefe54d38bdf869a3f78a46de62ab480aea066bb384a756a381e846bdacfd"},"2026.5.8:P02-Q18":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>二氧化碳甲烷化与选择性膜反应器</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题18 · P02-Q18</div><h1>二氧化碳甲烷化与选择性膜反应器</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡常数</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析竞争反应催化剂、速率常数比及温压与移水平衡。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应的热效应/化学反应热的计算/盖斯定律</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学反应条件的控制及优化</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡图像</span></div></details><details><summary>综合题小问分类</summary><ul class=\"subtopics\"><li><b>(1)</b> 两热化学反应相减<small>化学反应原理/化学反应的热效应/化学反应热的计算/盖斯定律</small></li><li><b>(2)①</b> 提高甲烷生成选择性<small>化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学反应条件的控制及优化；化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</small></li><li><b>(2)②</b> 活化能与速率常数图<small>化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能；化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</small></li><li><b>(3)</b> 升温对正逆速率常数比的影响<small>化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡常数；化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</small></li><li><b>(4)</b> 压强排序与高温竞争反应<small>化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素；化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡图像</small></li><li><b>(5)</b> 膜移水与出口质量比<small>化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡常数；化学反应原理/化学平衡/影响化学平衡的因素；认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</small></li></ul></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>18. 二氧化碳加氢制甲烷是实现“双碳”目标的有效方法之一，主要反应为</p><p>反应Ⅰ：<img src=\"chem-asset:04a80bf720b6e979a7aeaa4b7af3e3694e35b36b047646a098fbd88ec22ef2e1:1;\" style=\"width:272.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">  <img src=\"chem-asset:c314d194ab2e1ecaed59edfe9b5dfc6b5b87ff7687b4554b59785fdc78156d9a:2;\" style=\"width:94.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">kJ·mol<sup>-1</sup></p><p>反应Ⅱ：<img src=\"chem-asset:103f320e12f31a9af7af1cd25c6b3ac7e26e5956d018dd418d5c5027b4a69eda:3;\" style=\"width:249.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">  <img src=\"chem-asset:4766a64c5b6f524946f1576f3eb135a5dc370d9189a714efdb452b6aaa7d8340:4;\" style=\"width:87.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">kJ·mol<sup>-1</sup></p><p>（1）反应<img src=\"chem-asset:1c76d031adc35e26e310762f1c27c00cce1af5a604be66849d03684c556ae3ad:5;\" style=\"width:256.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">  <img src=\"chem-asset:7ad52236a90c32aefea7512b41744b1b1a49d693a6602d2a6467e3be3b3334ea:6;\" style=\"width:23.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则<img src=\"chem-asset:e872ca8f817c337375cf5812b098351ae6136d853714a157cb5143adfb7008c3:7;\" style=\"width:41.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">___________kJ·mol<sup>-1</sup>。</p><p>（2）一定温度条件下，利用不同催化剂，在相同反应时间内，测得产物的生成速率与催化剂的关系如图1。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:5d0f36add40031de649a2056bb324e4d8da8d23a7864af16260907b9c65f817d:8;\" style=\"width:528.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>①由图1可知，有利于获得甲烷的催化剂是___________(填“Cat1”、“Cat2”、“Cat3”或“Cat4”)。</p><p>②已知<img src=\"chem-asset:51302cedebc2d67b44d3a31308812b0598f989f72d5a0632f3336380b6fda036:9;\" style=\"width:126.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(k为速率常数，R、C均为常数)，下列关于反应Ⅱ在题设条件下<img src=\"chem-asset:313a987b8537be9d71e7a66c18c4c9c7229d5522688982497ec9676e4fa29649:10;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">图像与上述两种催化剂Cat1、Cat2关系对应正确的是___________(图2，填标号)。</p><p>（3）反应Ⅱ的正、逆反应速率分别表示为：<img src=\"chem-asset:84b70711587891c0475b058b7bc651286abd3b0ff3a646c34e52fccd429ecc6f:11;\" style=\"width:148.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；<img src=\"chem-asset:8a6352252965aa04cfe20b9bba0ee42ad3ca282b1310da8f230d3b06146f1d79:12;\" style=\"width:152.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，其中<img src=\"chem-asset:703b41d471017c5ee7c3a04bc94d71958b8f0f4d984f9ddd4f3eac843531b90e:13;\" style=\"width:21.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:181f0cfb5381ac59505833ef5ca0a9300c00ec8650f86bc81d4e3c3605add26d:14;\" style=\"width:21.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">分别为正、逆反应速率常数。升高温度时，<img src=\"chem-asset:70eac6d5de5553efef79ef65d45adc7e41bfffaf7ce63044c25320413fced3a8:15;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">___________(填“增大”、“减小”或“不变”)。</p><p>（4）不同条件下，按照<img src=\"chem-asset:369323b67a9695526ae6723cba5557f69389dd96b7602f5e111546c8869ce788:16;\" style=\"width:145.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">投料同时发生上述反应，<img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:17;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡转化率如图3所示。压强<img src=\"chem-asset:5e2fbb958ee062341f71c82b37399df2a7d1defde4b73a4f2e6e514174d3adf2:18;\" style=\"width:18.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:4ffd5698a27391773da7e1126c0ab50d7fb27821d8b900894b434438300814b3:19;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:55c3e06c932266f09edc9cb4ac3655da2b056f4ae6d549d777d0246aa9794345:20;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">由大到小的顺序是___________。压强为<img src=\"chem-asset:4ffd5698a27391773da7e1126c0ab50d7fb27821d8b900894b434438300814b3:19;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，温度高于700℃之后，温度升高转化率增大的原因是___________。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:98541428aaf12d515dcdc7d7d52fc9255400d1c90ef6edf96123f26fc5eeef44:21;\" style=\"width:356.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>（5）在PMPa、T℃下，将投料比<img src=\"chem-asset:fe2a98331d9f4100c4c9cc94921bff9f7bc983545f6f340379ef4752c6479aab:22;\" style=\"width:145.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的原料气匀速通过无分子筛膜多孔载体反应器，只发生反应Ⅱ，<img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:17;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡转化率为25%。同温同压下，若通入装有催化剂的新型膜反应器(如图4所示)，<img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:17;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡转化率为40%，则相同时间内出口a和出口b中<img src=\"chem-asset:7c2baf2285e55583d60c21307602ad1ca2b0cb04b00fe21753e47d5233cd385c:23;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的质量比为___________。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:adbd73dace1b9aa90c92f3b433b0d1f2fae6608b782edfcdf5a56e3a9ee0bf16:24;\" style=\"width:255.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】（1）-206.1    </p><p>（2）    ①. Cat4    ②. c    </p><p>（3）增大    （4）    ①. <img src=\"chem-asset:55c3e06c932266f09edc9cb4ac3655da2b056f4ae6d549d777d0246aa9794345:20;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&gt;<img src=\"chem-asset:4ffd5698a27391773da7e1126c0ab50d7fb27821d8b900894b434438300814b3:19;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&gt;<img src=\"chem-asset:5e2fbb958ee062341f71c82b37399df2a7d1defde4b73a4f2e6e514174d3adf2:18;\" style=\"width:18.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">    ②. 二氧化碳的平衡转化率为两个反应的平衡转化率之和，反应Ⅰ放热，温度升高，平衡逆向移动，反应Ⅱ吸热，温度升高平衡正向移动，温度高于700℃之后，温度升高转化率增大的原因是此时二氧化碳的转化率主要取决于反应Ⅱ。    </p><p>（5）<img src=\"chem-asset:00792d5c02b5aae221377412ef1907d0e100c8e5de0ffa359de5beab241d6a02:25;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【小问1详解】</p><p>根据盖斯定律，反应Ⅰ减去反应Ⅱ得<img src=\"chem-asset:1c76d031adc35e26e310762f1c27c00cce1af5a604be66849d03684c556ae3ad:5;\" style=\"width:256.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则<img src=\"chem-asset:a39a46ff31d6029967cfed427ba9ac86fb3b62a6f11fd111402e6b899b33d144:26;\" style=\"width:193.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>【小问2详解】</p><p>①根据图示可知，催化剂为Cat4时，甲烷生成速率最大且一氧化碳生成速率最小，有利于获得甲烷；</p><p>②根据关系式<img src=\"chem-asset:51302cedebc2d67b44d3a31308812b0598f989f72d5a0632f3336380b6fda036:9;\" style=\"width:126.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:334d4e3092fe57fff660cfd6fca9211b9338e74d3f253730a1270a867a61cd66:27;\" style=\"width:17.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">减小时，温度升高，反应速率加快，速率常数增大，纵坐标增大；根据图1，Cat1比Cat2在相同条件下的速率大，Cat1时活化能小，则斜率大的是Cat1，故选c。</p><p>【小问3详解】</p><p>反应Ⅱ是吸热反应，升高温度时，正反应速率增大的倍数大于逆反应速率增大的倍数，则<img src=\"chem-asset:70eac6d5de5553efef79ef65d45adc7e41bfffaf7ce63044c25320413fced3a8:15;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">增大。</p><p>【小问4详解】</p><p>反应Ⅰ为气体分子数减小的反应，相同温度下增大压强，平衡正向移动，二氧化碳的平衡转化率增大，故<img src=\"chem-asset:55c3e06c932266f09edc9cb4ac3655da2b056f4ae6d549d777d0246aa9794345:20;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&gt;<img src=\"chem-asset:4ffd5698a27391773da7e1126c0ab50d7fb27821d8b900894b434438300814b3:19;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&gt;<img src=\"chem-asset:5e2fbb958ee062341f71c82b37399df2a7d1defde4b73a4f2e6e514174d3adf2:18;\" style=\"width:18.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；二氧化碳的平衡转化率为两个反应的平衡转化率之和，反应Ⅰ放热，温度升高，平衡逆向移动，反应Ⅱ吸热，温度升高平衡正向移动，温度高于700℃之后，温度升高转化率增大的原因是此时二氧化碳的转化率主要取决于反应Ⅱ。</p><p>【小问5详解】</p><p>只发生反应Ⅱ，设通入的氢气物质的量为amol，则通入的二氧化碳物质的量为2amol，<img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:17;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡转化率为25%，列三段式    <img src=\"chem-asset:e6ee778160792b9303d0793c5c38d0b4d2dec98ebf136c792b354328fdd44ad6:28;\" style=\"width:361.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，该反应前后气体分子数不变，用物质的量代替物质的量浓度计算平衡常数<img src=\"chem-asset:ca2183c0fab900d80697d4c369a493c17247496d1a86c68cca48b6aa6a7d20c7:29;\" style=\"width:129.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。同温同压下，若通入装有催化剂的新型膜反应器，<img src=\"chem-asset:8e9096e1d90318e5f3c25aaf513f106de09d1002a99c9492495c3cb7e917227e:17;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡转化率为40%，列三段式<img src=\"chem-asset:0798c1fc671c40d0c914bcf39d9d55f9278e68bcc4da1765cf5b6890c72e29ff:30;\" style=\"width:361.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，根据K=<img src=\"chem-asset:19a48577fae60e3c92597e9edabda5378da54658a0ce0b76f735d411cbefbb1e:31;\" style=\"width:120.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=<img src=\"chem-asset:046421428bb7ccccf761c8afa4f4f752403a009665be3e61d0f6663462049998:32;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，解得n(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>a</sub><sub>出口</sub>=0.1a，则相同时间内出口a和出口b中<img src=\"chem-asset:7c2baf2285e55583d60c21307602ad1ca2b0cb04b00fe21753e47d5233cd385c:23;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的质量比=物质的量之比=<img src=\"chem-asset:dbb03397ac0093288fe4d061ff92c70adb880410254b79f9ebb443dfcbdfac3e:33;\" style=\"width:93.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["00792d5c02b5aae221377412ef1907d0e100c8e5de0ffa359de5beab241d6a02","046421428bb7ccccf761c8afa4f4f752403a009665be3e61d0f6663462049998","04a80bf720b6e979a7aeaa4b7af3e3694e35b36b047646a098fbd88ec22ef2e1","0798c1fc671c40d0c914bcf39d9d55f9278e68bcc4da1765cf5b6890c72e29ff","103f320e12f31a9af7af1cd25c6b3ac7e26e5956d018dd418d5c5027b4a69eda","181f0cfb5381ac59505833ef5ca0a9300c00ec8650f86bc81d4e3c3605add26d","19a48577fae60e3c92597e9edabda5378da54658a0ce0b76f735d411cbefbb1e","1c76d031adc35e26e310762f1c27c00cce1af5a604be66849d03684c556ae3ad","313a987b8537be9d71e7a66c18c4c9c7229d5522688982497ec9676e4fa29649","334d4e3092fe57fff660cfd6fca9211b9338e74d3f253730a1270a867a61cd66","369323b67a9695526ae6723cba5557f69389dd96b7602f5e111546c8869ce788","4766a64c5b6f524946f1576f3eb135a5dc370d9189a714efdb452b6aaa7d8340","4ffd5698a273917